-            text run at (0,154) width 589: "Now we are engaged in a great civil war, testing whether that"
-            text run at (588,154) width 7: " "
-            text run at (0,202) width 553: "nation, or any nation, so conceived, and so dedicated, can"
-            text run at (552,202) width 7: " "
-            text run at (0,250) width 600: "long endure. We are met here on a great battlefield of that war."
-            text run at (599,250) width 1: " "
-            text run at (0,298) width 552: "We have come to dedicate a portion of it as a final resting"
-            text run at (551,298) width 7: " "
-            text run at (0,346) width 539: "place for those who here gave their lives that that nation"
-            text run at (538,346) width 7: " "
-            text run at (0,394) width 598: "might live. It is altogether fitting and proper that we should do"
-            text run at (597,394) width 3: " "
-            text run at (0,442) width 596: "this. Four score and seven years ago our fathers brought forth,"
-            text run at (595,442) width 5: " "
-            text run at (0,490) width 575: "upon this continent, a new nation, conceived in Liberty, and"
-            text run at (574,490) width 7: " "
-            text run at (0,538) width 562: "dedicated to the proposition that all men are created equal."
